.Dd October 29, 2026
.Dt TZLINK 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm tzlink
.Nd set the system's time zone
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Ar zone
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
makes
.Pa /etc/localtime
a link to
.Ar zone Ns 's
file in
.Pa /var/db/timezone/zoneinfo ,
such as
.Ql America/Lima ,
replacing the old link in one step, and tells running programs that the
time zone changed.
Only the super-user may run it.
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width /var/db/timezone/zoneinfo -compact
.It Pa /etc/localtime
the system's time zone
.It Pa /var/db/timezone/zoneinfo
the time zones
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr date 1 ,
.Xr tzfile 5 ,
.Xr zic 8
.Sh HISTORY
Minkar's
.Nm
is its own.
